blic/images/apps/1579530/32fa742ccbb94b55fba8cd7ce0884e817fd18729.jpg"},{"name":"Stage 4 Difficulty Hardcore","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1579530/941b321d709a193992cc6dea964e12f493e35b74.jpg"}],"total":22},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1579530?t=1710494088","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1579530?t=1710494088","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579530/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1710494088","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579530/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1710494088","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<strong>** Please be aware this game contains flashing lights that may not be suitable for people with photosensitive conditions **</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pump up the volume, Get your party head on and Get Ready To Rave </strong></h2><br>Rebound Raver is a Brick Breaker style game from Retro Twist Games combining elements from the classic Break Out / Arkanoid games with a Pinball twist. Includes banging rave tracks from DJ Yan and audio light/visual FX for that rave club feel.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >current Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 70 Levels - 7 Stages With 10 Levels Per Stage<br></li><li> Level Unlocks - As you complete a Level it will become unlocked so you can replay your favourites<br></li><li> Pinball features - Flippers, Bumpers &amp; more<br></li><li> 4 Difficulty Levels - from Dad Dancer to Frantic<br></li><li> Speed Runs - Keep track of your time to complete Levels &amp; Stages, with a summary at the end of each level <br></li><li> High Scores - Steam Leaderboards for each levels high score and a total high score table<br></li><li> Achievements - Multiple Steam achievements<br></li><li> Music - Banging rave tracks from DJ YAN which play randomly every time you play<br></li><li> Audio Visual Light FX - FX react to the music</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Powerups:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> PowerBall - Destroys gems with one hit<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579530/extras/f1454b890e7acb6101d143eb769abc06.webp?t=1710494088\" width=32 height=32 /></span><br></li><li> SpeedBall - Ball moves faster<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579530/extras/SpeedBall.PNG?t=1710494088\" /></span><br></li><li> BigBall - Easier to hit targets<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579530/extras/BigBall.PNG?t=1710494088\" /></span><br></li><li> MultiBall - Spawns multiple balls in play<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579530/extras/9a7b753794c51686c2e17fd480a0297e.webp?t=1710494088\" width=32 height=32 /></span><br></li><li> ExtraBall - Gives an extra ball<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579530/extras/ce7730f5a78122af5964c47f57dca0f1.webp?t=1710494088\" width=32 height=32 /></span><br></li><li> CatchBall - Trap your ball to the Rebounder         <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579530/extras/889b9b3f0a582fba5a76fbd65afdca61.webp?t=1710494088\" width=32 height=32 /></span><br></li><li> Lazers - Enables lazer canons on the Rebounder <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579530/extras/52ee06c6e36b2e07ffdc7bed397dff9a.webp?t=1710494088\" width=32 height=32 /></span> <br></li><li> Shrink - Shrinks the Rebounder                             <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579530/extras/1dfcbf5c7d5f8c4e51ee90bd4b1c5040.webp?t=1710494088\" width=32 height=32 /></span><br></li><li> Expand - Expands the Rebounder<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579530/extras/826a106327d1ecb213fb560f570e375d.webp?t=1710494088\" width=32 height=32 /></span><br></li><li> SlowMo - Slows ball speed<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579530/extras/ef9f412c5b13a856e220c5a2650b4353.webp?t=1710494088\" width=32 height=32 /></span><br></li><li> Mystery Powerup - Random Powerup<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579530/extras/9fcc7271491b150392db85f3b0e1b4c4.webp?t=1710494088\" width=32 height=32 /></span></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deflectors</h2>The Rebounder has deflectors which you can be used to deflect the ball at different angles.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579530/extras/18b56d0f07842eae1a0b9b141b86f169.poster.avif?t=1710494088\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579530/extras/18b56d0f07842eae1a0b9b141b86f169.webm?t=1710494088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset